    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Hakuna historia iliyohifadhiwa bado; majibu ya karibuni tu ndio yanahamishwa.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Ongeza kifaa cha kupima nguvu ili kuona thamani halisi hapa.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Kusoma kwa moja kwa moja kutoka {0} kifaa kilichopimwa.", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Haiwezi kusoma vipimo (vyombo vinaweza kuwa nje ya mtandao).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Kinaendelea (usiku saa 23:00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Kinaendelea (kichocheo cha eneo kinakuja hivi karibuni)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Mkakati huu unafanya kazi kwa ratiba: wakati programu imefungwa (katika tray kwenye desktop), inakatisha nguvu kwa vifaa vilivyochaguliwa vya nishati kila usiku saa 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Mbinu hii inategemea vichocheo vya eneo; kichocheo cha eneo kiotomatiki bado hakipatikani. Kuwezesha husaidia kuhifadhi, lakini hakitafanya kiotomatiki.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Aina hii ya kichocheo bado haijafanya kazi kiotomatiki; mara tu ikihifadhiwa, inafanya kazi kwa wakati unaouchagua hapa chini (imepangwa).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Kichocheo cha hali ya usalama hakiwezi kusanidiwa: programu haina hali ya jopo la kengele inayoweza kusomwa au kubadilisha hali ya kiwango cha NEXUS bado. Aina zinazofanya kazi: Timer, Hali ya Hali ya Hewa, Hali ya Kifaa na Kengele Iliyowashwa (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Aina hii ya kichocheo bado haijatambuliwa, kwa hivyo haiwezi kuhifadhiwa. Aina zinazofanya kazi: Timer, Hali ya Hali ya Hewa, Hali ya Kifaa na Kengele Iliyowashwa (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "Hali ya Hali ya Hewa", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Taarifa halisi ya hali ya hewa kwa eneo lako la nyumbani husomwa kila takriban dakika 10 wakati programu imefunguliwa. Hali inalifanya mara moja wakati hali inabadilika kutoka kutokukidhi hadi kukidhiwa.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k (\u00b0C)": "Joto (\u00b0C)", // EN: Temperature (°C)
    "R\u00fczg\u00e2r (km/sa)": "Upepo (km/h)", // EN: Wind (km/h)
    "Ya\u011f\u0131\u015f (mm)": "Mvua (mm)", // EN: Precipitation (mm)
