    "Saat belirleyen bir otomasyon ekleyince bug\u00fcn\u00fcn plan\u0131 burada listelenir.": "Ongeza uendeshaji kiotomatiki na wakati na mpango wa leo utaorodheshwa hapa.", // EN: Add an automation with a time and today's plan will be listed here.
    "Otomasyon Ekle": "Ongeza Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki", // EN: Add Automation
