    "Kamera kontrol paneli \u00b7 durum ve gizlilik": "Paneli ya udhibiti wa kamera \u00b7 hali & faragha", // EN: Camera control panel · status & privacy
    "Sesle yaz": "Kuingiza kwa sauti", // EN: Voice input
    "Sesli giri\u015f bu taray\u0131c\u0131da desteklenmiyor (Chrome veya Edge kullan).": "Kuingiza kwa sauti hakutafadhiliwi kwenye kivinjari hiki (tumia Chrome au Edge).", // EN: Voice input isn't supported in this browser (use Chrome or Edge).
    "Mikrofon izni verilmedi.": "Idhini ya kipaza sauti imeruhusiwa.", // EN: Microphone permission was denied.
