    "Bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Inapatikana na akaunti ya wingu", // EN: Available with a cloud account
    "\u00d6nce bulut hesab\u0131nla giri\u015f yap.": "Ingia kwanza kwa akaunti yako ya wingu.", // EN: Sign in with your cloud account first.
    "Durum al\u0131namad\u0131": "Haiwezi kupakia hali", // EN: Couldn't load the status
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131 kodu a\u00e7\u0131k": "Kanuni ya Authenticator imewashwa", // EN: Authenticator code is on
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r.": "Uthibitisho hatua mbili unahitaji akaunti ya wingu.", // EN: Two-step verification needs a cloud account.
    "Kapatmak i\u00e7in kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki kodu gir.": "Weka kanuni ya authenticator kuizamisha.", // EN: Enter the authenticator code to turn it off.
    "Kodu kimlik uygulamas\u0131na okut, sonra uygulamadaki 6 haneyi gir.": "Skania kanuni na app ya authenticator, kisha ingiza namba 6.", // EN: Scan the code with your authenticator app, then enter the 6 digits.
    "Kurulum kodu": "Kanuni ya usanidi", // EN: Setup code
    "Kodu okutam\u0131yorsan bu anahtar\u0131 uygulamaya yaz:": "Ikiwa huwezi kuskania, andika kibodi hiki kwenye app:", // EN: If you can't scan it, type this key into the app:
    "Kod 6 hane olmal\u0131.": "Kanuni lazima iwe namba 6.", // EN: The code must be 6 digits.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti.": "Kanuni si sahihi au imeisha muda wake.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti. Telefonunun saati otomatik ayarl\u0131 de\u011filse kodlar tutmaz; saati otomati\u011fe al\u0131p yenilenen kodu bir kez dene.": "Kanuni si sahihi au imeisha muda wake. Kanuni hazilingani ikiwa saa ya simu yako haijasetwa kiotomatiki; badilisha iwe kiotomatiki kisha jaribu tena kanuni iliyo sasishwa mara moja.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired. Codes do not match if your phone's clock is not set automatically; switch it to automatic and try the refreshed code once.
    "Kod do\u011frulanamad\u0131.": "Kanuni haiwezi kuthibitishwa.", // EN: The code could not be verified.
    "\u0130\u015flem tamamlanamad\u0131.": "Hatua haikuweza kukamilika.", // EN: The action could not be completed.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Uthibitisho wa hatua mbili umewezeshwa.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Uthibitisho wa hatua mbili umezimwa.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Weka nambari ya tarakimu 6 kutoka kwenye programu yako ya uthibitishaji.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "Fungua programu ya uthibitishaji kama Google Authenticator au Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "Skana nambari iliyo hapa chini au ingiza ufunguo kwa mkono.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "Andika nambari ya tarakimu 6 kutoka kwenye programu na bonyeza Thibitisha.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Futa chochote kilicho ndani ya NEXUS ya zamani kwenye programu; kila usanidi unaunda ufunguo mpya, na nambari ya ile uliyoskania mwisho ndiyo halali.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "Muunganisho wa hali ya juu: ongeza vifaa vya Home Assistant", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Haiwezi kuunganishwa na kifaa. Hakikisha kiko kwenye mtandao huo huo na kwamba kitambulisho cha kifaa na ufunguo wa ndani ni sahihi.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Haiwezi kuunganishwa na broker. Hakikisha jina la mtumiaji na nywila ni sahihi.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
