    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Kuna tatizo na oda? Tuma maoni", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Vifaa vilivyo tayari vinafanya kazi sasa; vitu visivyo tayari vimepewa alama \"Jitayarishe hivi karibuni\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Msaada wa Apple Watch Utafika Hivi Karibuni", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS bado haijajumuisha programu ya Apple Watch. Mara itakapoachiliwa, utaweza kuendesha hali na kuona tahadhari muhimu kutoka kwenye mkono wako.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Kinachoweza Kufanywa Leo", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Weka arifa zikionekana kwa matukio muhimu; utaona tahadhari kwenye simu yako mara moja.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Je, arifa hizi zinaonekana kwenye saa yako inategemea mipangilio ya Watch ya iPhone yako; NEXUS haikitumii kitu chochote maalum kwenye saa.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Fungua Mipangilio ya Arifa", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Nakili ufunguo", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Fungua kwenye programu ya uthibitishaji", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Kama utapoteza upatikanaji wa programu yako ya uthibitishaji hutaweza kuingia, kwa sababu msimbo unahitajika wakati wa kuingia. Hifadhi ufunguo huu mahali salama.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Ufunguo umefanikiwa kunakiliwa \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Haikuweza kunakiliwa; andika ufunguo kwa mkono.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
