    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Futa Akaunti Yangu", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Akaunti yako, profaili na data zilizosawazishwa zimefutwa kabisa. Ikiwa una usajili hai wa NEXUS+, ungia kwenye Malipo kwanza kufuta. Hii haiwezi kurekebishwa.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Una uhakika? Gusa tena kufuta", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Inaendelea kufuta\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Akaunti imesafishwa. Kumbuka kufuta usajili wako kutoka kwenye akaunti yako ya Whop.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Akaunti yako na data zimefutwa.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Ili kuondoa data za NEXUS kwenye kifaa hiki, Mipangilio \u2192 Toka tu yanatosha; hakuna akaunti ya wingu.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Utekelezaji wa kufuta akaunti upande wa seva bado haujatumika. Unaweza kutoka kwa sasa.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Nimezima Usumbufu Haufanyi Kazi; hakuna arifa zitakazokuudhi. [KITENDO: WASA_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "Hali ya sasa inaweza kuendeshwa kwa kugusa mara moja kutoka kadi ya Tap to Run kwenye skrini kuu kwa sasa. Mara NEXUS itakapopatikana kwenye App Store, utaweza kuiongeza kwenye Siri moja kwa moja kutoka kwenye skrini hii.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "na mipangilio yake yote itaondolewa kikamilifu. Una uhakika?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
