    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Usomaji wa hivi karibuni", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Hatuzalishi alama; thamani halisi tu zilizokusanywa kutoka kwa vifaa vyako ndizo zinaonyeshwa.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
