    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Ukiongeza mwangaza, pazia, kikiwaau au kifaa cha hali ya hewa, maandalizi yanatafsiriwa hapa.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
