    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Mlolongo wa kuokoa haraka kwa plagi za akili na vifaa vinavyolenga nishati.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
