    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Chochea hali nyingine moja kwa moja wakati hali za vifaa vyako zinabadilika.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Pata maarifa kuhusu vifaa vyako na hifadhi kiotomatiki kwa mikakati.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Unaweza kuongeza vifaa vyako kwa skanningi ya kiotomatiki, msimbo wa QR, msimbo wa usanidi au katalogi ya mkono.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Pata maarifa kuhusu vifaa vyako na vidokezo vya nishati.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
