    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Kwa nini kifaa changu kinaonekana kuwa offline?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Andika anwani ya IP ya kifaa na NEXUS itaamua ni itikadi gani kinazungumza.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Angalia muunganisho wa Wi-Fi wa kifaa na router yako. Ikiwa tatizo linaendelea, ondoa kifaa na uongeze tena. Hatua: Vifaa > chagua kifaa > Ondoa.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Angalia muunganisho wa Wi-Fi wa kifaa na router yako. Ikiwa tatizo linaendelea, ondoa kifaa kutoka kwenye app ya NEXUS na uongeze tena.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ikiwa kifaa chako hakionekani, tumia skanningi ya QR au msimbo wa usanidi. Unaweza kufungua ukurasa wa msaada kwa msaada na mwongozo.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Huduma ya eneo (GPS) ya kifaa chako imezimwa. Washa na jaribu tena.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Kifaa chako hakikiungi mkono huduma za eneo.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Kifaa hakipo kwenye orodha? Tuma maoni", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
