    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Kamilisha Kuondoka Nyumbani", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Unda programu ya ukaguzi wa kuondoka nyumbani inayonyesha vifaa vilivyozimwa, hali ya kufunga milango na mipangilio ya nishati kwenye skrini moja. Ongeza vitufe vya kuzima haraka na kuwasha usalama.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Angalia vifaa vilivyozimwa, milango na hali ya nishati katika mtiririko mmoja unapokuwa unaondoka nyumbani.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Onyesha vifaa vilivyowashwa, milango na hali ya nishati kwenye skrini moja wakati wa kuondoka nyumbani.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Tazama taa, soketi, kiyoyozi na mpangilio wa usalama walio washwa kabla ya kuondoka nyumbani, kwenye paneli moja. Kusanya hatua za kuzima haraka na kuwezesha usalama katika mtiririko mmoja.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Tafadhali fanya ukaguzi wa mwisho kabla ya kuondoka.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Zima taa kiotomatiki baada ya kuondoka nyumbani.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Zima taa kiotomatiki baada ya kuondoka nyumbani na uwaweke tena mwingi unaporudi.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Zima kiyoyozi kiotomatiki wakati hakuna mtu nyumbani na epuka matumizi yasiyo ya lazima.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Kata umeme kwa vifaa vilivyo kwenye hali ya kusubiri kwa wakati unaochagua usiku.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Wakati wa kuondoka nyumbani", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
