    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Bonyeza kitufe cha mduara juu ya daraja, kisha gonga \u201cUnganisha daraja\u201d ndani ya sekunde 30.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Haiwezi kuunganishwa na daraja. Hakikisha uko kwenye mtandao uleule kisha jaribu tena.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
