    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Unaweza kujiunga kwa kuingiza msimbo huu katika \"Jiunge na Nyumbani\" ndani ya NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Endesha sinario zako za NEXUS kwa sauti na Siri kwa sekunde chache.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS ni ya kwanza-kwa-kikundi: data zako za kifaa zinabaki kwenye kifaa hiki, amri za kifaa zinaenda moja kwa moja kwenye mtandao wako wa ndani, na hakuna kinachoshirikishwa na watu wengine.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
