    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Sambaza ukaguzi wote wa nyumbani unaohitaji kabla ya kulala kwenye kitovu kimoja. Nyamaza taa, usikanganye, angalia kufunga na mipangilio ya hali ya usiku kwenye skrini moja.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Tengeneza kituo cha maandalizi ya usingizi kinachosimamia taa, hali tulivu, kufunga milango na hali ya hewa kabla ya kulala. Ongeza muhtasari wa ukaguzi wa mwisho na hali ya usiku kwa kugusa moja.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
