    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Zima taa na TV; acha vishikizo na AC vitumike kwa namna ya kawaida.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Washisha kifaa au kizime", // EN: Turn a device on or off
