    "Hen\u00fcz do\u011frulanmad\u0131": "Haijathibitishwa bado", // EN: Not yet verified
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz ger\u00e7ek bir cihazla denenmedi.": "Aina hii ya muunganisho haijajaribiwa bado na kifaa halisi.", // EN: This connection type has not been tested with a real device yet.
