    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Orodha yako ya vifaa, otomatiki, mandhari na mipangilio imehifadhiwa kwenye faili. Nenosiri za kifaa, funguo za ndani, tokeni ya Telegram na kikao chako haviingii kwenye chelezo.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Hamisha chelezo", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Ripoti ya Hitilafu", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Makosa yanayotokea katika programu hutumwa kwetu kiotomatiki na kwa siri (hakuna data binafsi). Unaweza kuizima hapa chini.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Tuma Ripoti za Makosa Zisizo na Jina", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Tuma ripoti za makosa zisizo na jina", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Rudisha kutoka kwenye nakala ya akiba", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Tayari kwa vifaa vyako vilivyopangwa; imeongezwa kwa kugusa mara moja.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Tayari kwa ajili yako", // EN: Ready for you
    "Dokununca e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131nda hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Inaendesha kwenye vifaa vyako vilivyopangwa mara tu unapogusa.", // EN: Runs on your paired devices as soon as you tap it.
    "Ayarlarda ara": "Tafuta mipangilio", // EN: Search settings
    "Bu aramayla e\u015fle\u015fen ayar yok.": "Hakuna mpangilio unaolingana na utafutaji huu.", // EN: No setting matches this search.
    "Yenilemek i\u00e7in b\u0131rak\u0131n": "Ruhusu ili kusasisha", // EN: Release to refresh
    "Yenileniyor\u2026": "Inasasisha\u2026", // EN: Refreshing…
    "Yenilendi": "Imesasishwa", // EN: Refreshed
    "NEXUS Kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131": "Mtumiaji wa NEXUS", // EN: NEXUS User
    "NEXUS ana sayfa": "Nyumbani NEXUS", // EN: NEXUS home
    "Ana men\u00fc": "Menyu kuu", // EN: Main menu
