    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Tafadhali ingiza barua pepe sahihi.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Akaunti yenye barua pepe hii tayari ipo. Tafadhali ingia.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Kiungo hiki kimeisha au si sahihi. Tafadhali jaribu tena.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Akaunti ya wingu imezimwa katika toleo hili; nywila za akaunti za ndani haziwezi kuwekwa upya.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Kama anwani hii imeunganishwa na akaunti, kiungo cha kuweka upya kimetumwa. Angalia kikasha chako (na folda ya barua taka).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Jaribio nyingi sana. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Haikuweza kutuma kiungo.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "Tuma tena", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Nenosiri lako limebadilishwa. Sasa unaweza kuingia.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Weka nenosiri lako lililo sasa.", // EN: Enter your current password.
    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "Nenosiri lililo sasa si sahihi.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "Nenosiri jipya lazima liwe tofauti na la zamani.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "Kikao hakikupatikani. Toka na uingie tena.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
    "\u015eifre g\u00fcncellenemedi.": "Haikuweza kusasisha nenosiri.", // EN: Could not update the password.
    "Davet e-postas\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Kutuma barua pepe ya mwaliko\u2026", // EN: Sending invitation email…
    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Barua pepe hii tayari ina akaunti; wanaweza kujiunga kwa kutumia msimbo.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
