    "Son 7 g\u00fcn \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazdaki ger\u00e7ek \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerden": "Siku 7 za mwisho \u00b7 kutoka kwa vipimo halisi kwenye kifaa hiki tu", // EN: Last 7 days · from real measurements on this device only
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "Siku 7 za mwisho", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Hakuna vipimo vilivyorekodiwa bado. Ongeza kifaa kinachopima nguvu na fungua ukurasa huu; vipimo vitakusanywa hapa.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Vipindi bila vipimo havihesabiwi, kwa hivyo thamani zinaweza kuwa chini ya matumizi halisi.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
    "Elektrik birim fiyat\u0131 (kWh ba\u015f\u0131na)": "Bei ya umeme (kila kWh)", // EN: Electricity price (per kWh)
