    "Para birimi": "Sarafu", // EN: Currency
    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Gharama iliyokadiriwa, si bili. Bei inahifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki pekee.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
    "G\u00fcnl\u00fck t\u00fcketim, son 7 g\u00fcn (kWh)": "Matumizi ya kila siku, siku 7 zilizopita (kWh)", // EN: Daily usage, last 7 days (kWh)
