    "Cihaz eklenince haz\u0131r senaryolar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Taa zilizotengenezwa tayari zitaonekana hapa mara tu utakapoongeza kifaa.", // EN: Ready-made scenes will appear here once you add a device.
