    "Bu evde cihaz kontrol iznin yok. Ev sahibi izni a\u00e7abilir.": "Huna ruhusa ya kudhibiti kifaa hiki katika nyumba hii. Mmiliki anaweza kukizima.", // EN: You don't have device control permission in this home. The owner can turn it on.
    "Mesaj\u0131 Sil": "Futa Ujumbe", // EN: Delete Message
    "Bu mesaj t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in silinir.": "Ujumbe huu umefutwa kwa wanachama wote.", // EN: This message is deleted for all members.
    "Son 15 dk i\u00e7inde": "Ndani ya dakika 15 zilizopita", // EN: Within the last 15 minutes
    "Aile mesajlar\u0131 ve payla\u015f\u0131lan uyar\u0131lar": "Ujumbe wa familia na arifa zilizoshirikiwa", // EN: Family messages and shared alerts
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Shiriki arifa muhimu", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Kichwa na maandishi mafupi ya matukio ya usalama/dhima kwenye kifaa hiki yanaonekana kwenye programu za wanachama wengine katika nyumba hii. Maelezo ya kifaa na funguo hayatashirikishwa; kila mwanachama anafuata mipangilio yake ya arifa.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Toka Nyumbani", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Toka", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ingiza msimbo kutoka kwa barua pepe ya mwaliko. Msimbo huu unatumika mara moja tu na unafanya kazi tu na anuani ya barua pepe iliyoomeshwa.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Inahitajika kuingia", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Ingia kwanza ili kualika wanachama; utaunganishwa na akaunti ya nyumba yako kiotomatisi.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "Barua pepe haikuweza kutumwa kutoka kwenye seva", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Mwongozo umeundwa lakini barua pepe ya kiotomatisi haikuweza kutumwa. Je, tuitengenezee maandishi ya mwaliko ukitumia programu yako ya barua pepe?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Fungua Programu ya Barua Pepe", // EN: Open Mail App
    "I\u015f\u0131k d\u00fczeyi": "Kiwango cha mwanga", // EN: Light level
    "Bas\u0131n\u00e7": "Shinikizo", // EN: Pressure
    "Hareket alg\u0131land\u0131": "Mwendo umegundulika", // EN: Motion detected
    "Hareket yok": "Hakuna mwendo", // EN: No motion
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Haikuweza kuunganishwa na kifaa. Hakikisha kiko kwenye mtandao huo huo.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Haikuweza kuunganishwa na kifaa. Hakikisha kiko kwenye mtandao huo huo na kuwa anwani ya IP na ufunguo wa ndani (local key) ziko sahihi.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Inawasha taa kwa rangi ya joto, hufungua pazia na kuweka AC kwenye 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Inawasha taa na kufungua pazia, inazima AC kwa 22\u00b0 na inamutumia sumaku kurudi kwa chaji.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Inaizima taa, TV na AC, inafunga pazia na kufunga mlango.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Zima taa na TV, funika pazia na kufunga mlango.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Weka taa kwa rangi ya joto kwa 15%, funika pazia na kuwasha TV.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Funga mlango na funika pazia.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Washa taa kwa mwangaza wa 70%.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Anza roboti ya kusafisha sakafu.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Siku za kazi 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Weka AC na termosta kwenye hali ya faraja na ifanye purifier ya hewa kufanya kazi.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Tuma taarifa", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Hali hii haizamii yoyote ya vifaa vyako vya sasa. Ili ifanye kazi, ongeza kifaa kinachofaa (mfano, taa, pazia au roboti ya kusafisha).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Unda nyumba mpya, au jiunge na moja ukiwa na msimbo wa mwaliko uliopelekwa kwako.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Haujashirikishwa. Nyumba zinahifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki tu. Ingia ili kualika wanachama, jiunge na nyumba na tumia gumzo la familia.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
